            "type": "HTML",
            "data": "<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>Show DataFrame</h1>\n<p><code>df.show()</code> is the Spark native API that displays data but it&rsquo;s not pretty.</p>\n<p><code>z.show(df)</code> is a Zeppelin build-in feature that allows you to show a df result in a pretty way</p>\n\n</div>"
          }
        ]
